# Cross-compiled Rust libraries. Produced by cargo-ndk from clients/android/jni
# and copied in at build time — committing them would put four binaries in the
# repository that nobody can review and that go stale the moment the Rust
# changes. The CI job builds them; app/build.gradle.kts fails a release build
# if they are absent.
app/src/main/jniLibs/
